&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Main character returns to his home town where he had many precious memories. He meets a beautiful child Nagisa, and the two have sex due to a misunderstanding. Young people become lovers, but protagonist also seeks for the past love of his memories.&lt;/p&gt;
